put('23-bcb-013','Identifies labelling requirements for radon/soil-gas piping and distinguishes Part 3 and Part 9 routes.','Radon rough-in/active soil-depressurization piping.','Use the relevant Part 3 designed-system or Part 9 prescriptive route.|Provide the specified radon-only labels at the required locations.','B:6.2.1.1. B:9.13.4.3.','building-envelope-insulation-cladding hvac-ventilation-plumbing')
